\pard\b\fs28 Hail Mary, Gentle Women I Carey Laundry\b0\fs22\par
\par
Hail Mary, full of grace, The Lord is with you,\par
Blessed are you among women,\par
And blessed is the fruit of your womb, Jesus.\par
Holy Mary, Mother of God,\par
Pray for us sinners now,\par
And at the hour of death, Amen.\par
\par
\par
Refrain\par
Gentle woman, quiet light,\par
Morning star, so strong and bright,\par
Gentle mother, peaceful dove,\par
Teach us wisdom, teach us love.\par
\par
Verse 1\par
You were chosen by the Father,\par
You were chosen for the Son,\par
You were chosen from all women,\par
And for woman, shining one.\par
\par
Refrain\par
Gentle woman, quiet light,\par
Morning star, so strong and bright,\par
Gentle mother, peaceful dove,\par
Teach us wisdom, teach us love.\par
\par
Verse 2\par
Blessed are you among women,\par
Blest in turn all women, too.\par
Blessed they with peaceful spirits.\par
Blessed they with gentle hearts.\par
\par
Refrain\par
Gentle woman, quiet light,\par
Morning star, so strong and bright,\par
Gentle mother, peaceful dove,\par
Teach us wisdom, teach us love.\par
Teach us wisdom; teach us love.\par
